          "date": "2026-10-26 19:20:36.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-930 doc: add detail to llapi_fid2path_at(3)",
        "message": "LU-930 doc: add detail to llapi_fid2path_at(3)\n\nThe llapi_fid2path_at() man page didn't adequately explain how to use\nthe linkno and recno parameters. This made it difficult for users to\nunderstand how to print out every path for files with multiple\nhardlinks. I had to read the source code for lfs_fid2path() to figure\nout how to correctly use the API.\n\nThis adds an explanation of the parameters and an example so that it\nwill be more obvious how to use the API.\n\nSigned-off-by: Thomas Bertschinger <bertschinger@lanl.gov>\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nChange-Id: I886de8b79a1b8079ab24cea54bb7c27c93d90b44\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
